'''Denmark''' is the 29th stage in [[Empire of Cats]]. [[Le'boin]] is introduced here. Upon completion in Chapter 1, [[Bondage Cat (Special Cat)|Bondage Cat]] will be available to unlock in the [[Upgrade Menu]].

