==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Shizuoka Prefecture'''.
*Denmark's base is [[wikipedia:The Little Mermaid (statue)|''The Little Mermaid'']], a bronze statue based on the fairy tale of the same name.
*Demark's [[Treasure]], Fairy Tales, is an indirect reference to [[wikipedia:Hans Christian Andersen|Hans Christian Anderson]], the Danish author behind a huge number of fairy tales that are well-remembered to this day.
*Shizuoka Prefecture's base is [[wikipedia:Mount Fuji|Mount Fuji]], Japan's tallest mountain and most popular tourist attraction.
**In [[The Aku Realms]], Mount Fuji appears as [[Mount Aku (Aku Realm)|its own stage]] which comes after Shizuoka Prefecture, though it is renamed to Mount Aku in [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

